From 6ec45e0f7e49d01900eb9b33fa2a788914a4e082 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 00:34:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02217/11362] [outer-loop] aggregate scorecard -> 10 reproduced
 levels/8 games (metaharness ingests sweep solves)

Extend arc3_replay_scorecard_metaharness.py to read the arc_explore_trajectory
format and add cd82/sp80/su15/tu93. Independent confirmation: total
levels_completed=10 across 8 games (sc25 still reproduces to L0 offline, correctly
provisional). Matches ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml reproducible_total_levels: 10.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 results/arc3_replay_aggregate_scorecard.json | 28 ++++++++++++++++++--
 scripts/arc3_replay_scorecard_metaharness.py |  9 ++++++-
 2 files changed, 34 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/results/arc3_replay_aggregate_scorecard.json b/results/arc3_replay_aggregate_scorecard.json
